sequenceDiagram
  actor R as Rider
  participant D as Deliveries
  participant P as Pop-up
  participant X as Report damaged gallon
  participant S as Server
  participant G as Phone (GPS, dialer, maps)
  R->>D: 1: Log in as Rider
  D->>S: 2: GET /api/rider/deliveries
  S-->>D: 3: Orders out for delivery
  D->>G: 4: Read the location every 15 s
  D->>S: 5: POST /api/rider/location (Location Sharing on)
  R->>D: 6: Tap Call or Directions
  D->>G: 7: Open the dialer or Google Maps
  alt Delivered
    R->>D: 8: Tap Delivered
    D->>P: 9: Paid or Unpaid
    P->>S: 10: POST /api/rider/orders/{id}/delivered
    S-->>D: 11: Order removed from the list
  else Not delivered
    R->>D: 12: Tap Not delivered
    D->>P: 13: Note, Confirm
    P->>S: 14: POST /api/rider/orders/{id}/not-delivered
  else Damaged gallon
    R->>D: 15: Tap Report damaged gallon
    D->>X: 16: Photo and note, Send
    X->>S: 17: POST /api/damage
  end
  S-->>D: 18: Location Sharing off after the last order
